  "notes": "Breaking a thing apart: a tear or a smash. The constants are the kinds in the order a room offers them, the disposition a thing broken apart is left with, and for each material in data/item/kits.yml's order how it tears and how it smashes: null where it does not, else what it leaves and the check it takes, [ability, what it takes off], or null for none. A case gives a kind and either a thing (name, material, fixture, bound) with the player's abilities, where offered is whether the room offers that attempt on it (a portable thing of a material that allows it, not already what a break of its material leaves, that no open beat is bound to, whose check, if any, the ability reaches: its score less what it takes off is above zero) and possible is the same but for the beat guard; or a row, where pieces is the columns of the row the thing leaves before where it lies, its properties naming the row's id as pieces_of (the pieces record), or null where its material does not break apart that way.",
  "constants": {"kinds":["tear","smash"],"disposition":"divided","acts":[{"material":"paper","tear":{"leaves":"scraps","check":null},"smash":null},{"material":"cloth","tear":{"leaves":"strips","check":["strength",2]},"smash":null},{"material":"rope","tear":null,"smash":null},{"material":"wood","tear":null,"smash":null},{"material":"leather","tear":null,"smash":null},{"material":"glass","tear":null,"smash":{"leaves":"shards","check":null}},{"material":"pottery","tear":null,"smash":{"leaves":"shards","check":null}},{"material":"metal","tear":null,"smash":null},{"material":"stone","tear":null,"smash":null},{"material":"food","tear":null,"smash":null}]},
